    <section id="use-cases">
        <div class="section-label">Use Cases</div>
        <h2>What teams build with our data</h2>
        <div class="about-highlights">
            <div class="about-highlight card card--padded-sm">
                <img src="/images/uc-buzz-leads-price.svg" alt="Chart showing buzz score spiking before stock price follows" width="320" height="216" loading="lazy">
                <h3>Social buzz leads price</h3>
                <p>Retail attention on Reddit, X and Polymarket spikes before price moves. Our buzz score tracks that buildup across 5 sources so you can position before the breakout.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="about-highlight card card--padded-sm">
                <img src="/images/uc-cross-source.svg" alt="TSLA sentiment comparison across Reddit, X, News and Polymarket" width="320" height="216" loading="lazy">
                <h3>One ticker, four perspectives</h3>
                <p>Reddit bullish, X bearish on the same ticker. That spread is a signal. Our API returns sentiment from every source in one call so you catch what single-source tools miss.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="about-highlight card card--padded-sm">
                <img src="/images/uc-agent-workflow.svg" alt="AI agent workflow calling adanos-cli to get sentiment from 5 sources" width="320" height="216" loading="lazy">
                <h3>Your agent's market expert</h3>
                <p>Your agent calls adanos-cli and gets structured JSON from 5 sources in under 200ms. Works with Claude, ChatGPT or any tool-use framework out of the box.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

