            <div class="section-label">Why Adanos?</div>
            <h2>One API key. Five data sources.</h2>
            <p class="about-lead">We turn noisy market conversations into clean sentiment signals. Our API covers Reddit, X, financial news, Polymarket and crypto communities so you can focus on analysis instead of data collection.</p>
            <p class="about-lead">One API key for five sentiment APIs across stocks and crypto. Built in Berlin and used by quant teams, fintech startups and independent researchers.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="about-highlights">
            <div class="about-highlight card card--padded-sm">
                <div class="about-highlight-icon card-icon">
                    <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 20V10"/><path d="M18 20V4"/><path d="M6 20v-4"/></svg>
                </div>
                <h3>Hourly refresh</h3>
                <p>Sentiment data from Reddit, X, crypto communities and prediction markets. Continuously ingested, typically refreshed about every hour.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="about-highlight card card--padded-sm">
                <div class="about-highlight-icon card-icon">
                    <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 12h-4l-3 9L9 3l-3 9H2"/></svg>
                </div>
                <h3>High availability</h3>
                <p>We target 99.9% uptime and monitor around the clock. A contractual SLA is included on the Professional plan.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="about-highlight card card--padded-sm">
                <div class="about-highlight-icon card-icon">
                    <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M16 18l6-6-6-6"/><path d="M8 6l-6 6 6 6"/></svg>
                </div>
                <h3>Developer-first</h3>
                <p>RESTful APIs, JSON responses and CLI tools. Built for developers and AI agents.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

